[0.164, "o", "\u001b[1;35mQuirl - a well-stirred shell\u001b[0m\r\nOne binary for familiar commands, typed data, and a sandboxed Lua SDK.\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m> data [{\"service\":\"api\",\"status\":\"up\",\"latency_ms\":18},{\"service\":\"worker\",\"status\":\"degraded\",\"latency_ms\":91}] | where status == \"degraded\" | select service status latency_ms\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.038, "o", "service\tstatus\tlatency_ms\r\nworker\tdegraded\t91\r\n"]
[2.010, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m> complete git commit --am\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.051, "o", "--amend                      Replace the tip of the current branch\r\n"]
[2.013, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m> eval return { answer = 6 * 7, runtime = \"sandboxed Lua 5.4\" }\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.044, "o", "{\r\n  \"answer\": 42,\r\n  \"runtime\": \"sandboxed Lua 5.4\"\r\n}\r\n"]
[2.011, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m> check hello.lua\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.055, "o", "✓ hello.lua is valid\r\n"]
[2.008, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m> describe quirl run --format markdown\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.045, "o", "# `quirl run <file|-> [--lang lua|quirl|bash|zsh] [arguments...]`\r\n\r\nRun a script through its explicit language engine\r\n\r\nReads at most 4 MiB from an admitted regular file, or bounded standard input. Selects a language by explicit flag, shebang, or extension; Lua uses the restricted VM, `.qrl` uses native executors, and `.quirl` plus `.🌀` are accepted native aliases. Bash/Zsh use reference interpreters with startup files disabled and structured capture.\r\n\r\n## I/O contract\r\n\r\n- Input: `Nothing`\r\n- Output: `Bytes`\r\n- Live streaming: `false`\r\n\r\n## Options\r\n\r\n- `arguments` — Positional `arguments` declared by the builtin command signature.\r\n- `file|-` — Positional `file|-` declared by the builtin command signature.\r\n- `--lang` — Select the language explicitly, including for stdin\r\n\r\n## Examples\r\n\r\n```sh\r\nquirl run scripts/deploy.lua -- staging\r\n```\r\n\r\n```sh\r\nquirl run --lang lua -\r\n```\r\n\r\n```sh\r\nquirl run --lang bash legacy.sh\r\n```\r\n\r\n```sh\r\nquirl run --lang zsh release.zsh\r\n```\r\n\r\n"]
[2.015, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[1;32mOK Tour complete. Run /Users/niklasheer/Projects/github.com/niklas-heer/quirl/target/release/quirl for the full interactive shell.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
